Description: Tools for importing, processing, visualizing,
    fitting, comparing, and interpreting in vitro rumen gas
    production data from ANKOM systems. The package provides
    multiple kinetic models, model comparison workflows,
    treatment-level summaries, diagnostic tools, and
    visualization functions for rumen fermentation studies.
